---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import CallToAction from '../../components/CallToAction.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="FM26 Recruitment Planning | FM AI Assistent" description="Find transfer targets, compare finalists, track recruitment evidence and model FM26 squad moves using your loaded save data." path="/features/recruitment/">
  <div class="page-shell"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Features',href:'/features/'},{label:'Recruitment'}]} /><header class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">From need to shortlist</p><h1>Plan realistic recruitment in FM26.</h1><p class="lead">Connect tactical needs to candidates in the current save, compare exact finalists and test squad moves without hiding missing price or wage information.</p></header>
    <section class="section feature-showcase"><div><h2>Keep the recruitment trail visible.</h2><p>Task-level tools can identify weak slots, recruit for both roles in a tactic position, find replacements for an incumbent and compare selected player IDs.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Record agent-enquiry or in-game evidence on a local board</li><li>Keep evidence isolated by career and time-bound by in-game date</li><li>Model arrivals, departures, optimized XI and depth effects</li><li>Create an importable player-shortlist <code>.fmf</code> file</li></ul></div><figure class="screenshot-frame"><a href="/images/recruitment.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the recruitment board screenshot at full size"><img src="/images/recruitment.png" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" alt="FM AI Assistent recruitment board with candidates, evidence sources and validity dates" /></a><figcaption><span>The genuine recruitment board preserves evidence and its validity window.</span><a href="/images/recruitment.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View full size ↗</a></figcaption></figure></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Illustrative workflow</p><h2>Recruit for the role, not the headline.</h2></div><p>A practical answer should remain traceable to the loaded snapshot and your stated constraints.</p></div><div class="steps"><article class="step"><h3>Diagnose</h3><p>Find the weak slot in the loaded tactic and current squad.</p></article><article class="step"><h3>Shortlist</h3><p>Search both relevant roles with age, ability and finance constraints.</p></article><article class="step"><h3>Verify</h3><p>Compare exact player IDs and add evidence learned in-game.</p></article><article class="step"><h3>Model</h3><p>Test the depth and financial effect of the intended moves.</p></article></div><p class="notice"><strong>Unknown means unknown.</strong> Missing asking prices, wage demands and sale proceeds are not silently treated as zero.</p></section>
  </div><CallToAction eyebrow="Plan the window" title="Make every target explainable." />
</BaseLayout>
